{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the story of Dominic, a man with the unique power to eject blades from his wrists. After learning about missing people in his hometown, Dominic stumbles upon a cult that collects blood. Why do they hoard it, and who else is trying to stop them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191550/extras/Timeline_2.gif?t=1743896038\" />Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Violent, blood-pumping action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 playable characters with unique play styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">57 levels of ramping  difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story of mystery and intrigue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made by one guy with a dream</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Post-game challenges!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all the S ratings by completing levels under a certain time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play every level as your favorite character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardcore mode: Can you beat the whole game without dying?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed running</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191550/extras/darius_chathead.png?t=1743896038\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3191550?t=1743896038","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3191550?t=1743896038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191550/c036129c6e6692378424d7b2929f3b1da60688cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743896038","capsule_imagev5":"https://